{"seq":2,"slug":"rule-testing-coverage-simulation-regression","title":"规则测试：决策表覆盖、场景仿真与变更影响回归","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/business-rule-decision-engine-rete-dmnn-drools-cel-opa/rule-governance-testing-ops/rule-testing-coverage-simulation-regression","wordCount":2976,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"规则测试-决策表覆盖-场景仿真与变更影响回归\">规则测试：决策表覆盖、场景仿真与变更影响回归</h1><p>一条&quot;新客首单包邮&quot;规则上线第三天，某目的国清关失败率涨了两个百分点——运营发现它把 <code>[0..49)</code> 金额段的运费覆盖成了 <code>free</code>，而原表更下方的&quot;低申报金额海关抽查&quot;规则被 First 命中策略默默抢走了。没有异常、没有报错、没有测试失败，因为<strong>从来没有人测过&quot;这两行同时命中时会怎样&quot;</strong>。规则系统与普通后端最不一样的地方就在这里：规则是可配置制品，改动不经编译器，错误的形态是&quot;静默地返回了另一个合法值&quot;。本文讨论如何用三层测试压住这个静默风险——静态覆盖度分析、动态场景仿真、变更影响回归。决策表求值语义见 <a href=\"../dmn-decision-table-expression/dmn-decision-table-hit-policy-completeness\">../3_dmn-decision-table-expression/1_dmn-decision-table-hit-policy-completeness.md</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-规则测试的三种粒度\">核心概念：规则测试的三种粒度</h2><p>代码测试覆盖<strong>路径</strong>——语句、分支、条件组合。规则测试覆盖<strong>输入空间</strong>：一张决策表定义的是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>×</mo><mo>⋯</mo><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D = D_1 \\times \\dots \\times D_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 上的分段函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f: D \\to O</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span></span></span></span></span>，规则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 覆盖的区域 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 由该行各输入条的笛卡尔积决定。测试要回答&quot;哪些区域被覆盖、哪些是洞、边界归属对不对&quot;。这带来三个与普通代码测试根本不同的性质。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>没有编译器保护，错误还是静默的。</strong> 运营追加一行不需改代码；无命中返回 <code>null</code>/默认值、重叠命中被 P/F 策略消解，两者都不抛异常，只在结算或清关时暴露为业务错误。</li>\n<li><strong>组合空间远超规则数量。</strong> 10 个布尔输入就有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1024</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{10} = 1024</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1024</span></span></span></span></span> 个区域，而跨境维度（国家 × 会员等级 × 金额段 × HS 章节 × 支付方式 × 风控分）不可全枚举。</li>\n<li><strong>变更无需发布代码，回归风险落在数据分段而非控制流上。</strong> 一次运营改动即一次生产变更，不能只靠&quot;合并前过评审&quot;这道传统闸门。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>因此规则测试必须分三层，缺一层就有盲区：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[规则集] --&gt; B[第一层 覆盖度分析&lt;br/&gt;静态 回答规则表有没有洞与重叠]&#10;    A --&gt; C[第二层 场景仿真&lt;br/&gt;动态 回答给定事实跑出来对不对]&#10;    A --&gt; D[第三层 影响回归&lt;br/&gt;变更 回答改一行会不会动到别的场景]&#10;    B --&gt; E[合并门 覆盖率不低于基线]&#10;    C --&gt; E&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[上线 影子流量 + decision log 监控]&#10;    F --&gt; G{决策分布漂移?}&#10;    G --&gt;|是| H[回滚到上一 ruleset 版本]&#10;    G --&gt;|否| I[全量生效]\">graph TD\n    A[规则集] --&gt; B[第一层 覆盖度分析&lt;br/&gt;静态 回答规则表有没有洞与重叠]\n    A --&gt; C[第二层 场景仿真&lt;br/&gt;动态 回答给定事实跑出来对不对]\n    A --&gt; D[第三层 影响回归&lt;br/&gt;变更 回答改一行会不会动到别的场景]\n    B --&gt; E[合并门 覆盖率不低于基线]\n    C --&gt; E\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[上线 影子流量 + decision log 监控]\n    F --&gt; G{决策分布漂移?}\n    G --&gt;|是| H[回滚到上一 ruleset 版本]\n    G --&gt;|否| I[全量生效]</pre><p>第一层是<strong>静态</strong>的：不执行规则，只分析表的几何结构。第二层是<strong>动态</strong>的：构造事实、跑引擎、断言输出。第三层是<strong>差分</strong>的：同一批事实在两个规则版本上跑，比较输出差异。三层的成本递增、发现缺陷的时间点递增，所以覆盖度分析要放在最前面。</p>\n<h2 id=\"决策表覆盖度与边界值分析\">决策表覆盖度与边界值分析</h2><p>覆盖度指标必须与规则表的结构对齐，而不是套用代码覆盖率。DMN 表的可度量单元有四个层级：规则行、输入单元格、区间端点、以及列间的取值组合。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>覆盖指标</th>\n<th>度量对象</th>\n<th>形式化</th>\n<th>跨境语义</th>\n<th>工具可得性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>行覆盖</td>\n<td>每条规则至少命中一次</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∃</mi><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\lvert\\{i:\\exists x,\\,x\\in R_i\\}\\rvert}{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.355em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.01em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.485em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">∣{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">:</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">∃</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">}∣</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>新增的关税分段行有没有被测到</td>\n<td>Drools Test Scenario；OPA <code>opa test --coverage</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输入条覆盖</td>\n<td>每个输入单元格的每个取值/区间</td>\n<td>逐单元格计数</td>\n<td><code>[49..99)</code> 这个区间被落到过吗</td>\n<td>需自建生成器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>边界覆盖</td>\n<td>每个区间端点及其内外邻近值</td>\n<td>端点内、端点、端点外</td>\n<td>免税额 800 USD：799.99 / 800.00 / 800.01</td>\n<td>需自建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>组合覆盖</td>\n<td>任意两列的全部取值对（pairwise）</td>\n<td>见下文公式</td>\n<td>国家 × 会员等级 × 金额段</td>\n<td>NIST ACTS、PICT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>完备性/一致性</td>\n<td>U/A 表无空洞且无重叠</td>\n<td>静态可判定</td>\n<td>U 表返回 <code>null</code> 即漏洞</td>\n<td>DMN 合规校验阶段</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>边界值分析是规则测试回报最高的一项投入。</strong> 一个输入列若被切成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个区间（如金额 <code>[0..49)</code>、<code>[49..99)</code>、<code>[99..+)</code>），每列至少需 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个测试点：端点内、端点、端点外各一。区间的开闭直接决定边界归属——FEEL 中 <code>[</code> <code>]</code> 为闭、<code>(</code> <code>)</code> 为开，<code>[0..49)</code> 含 0 不含 49 而 <code>[49..99)</code> 含 49，49 这个值恰好是两行分界，写错一个括号就同时制造一个重叠和一个空洞。跨境场景里这类值都是监管或平台给定的硬阈值：欧盟 IOSS 的 150 EUR 免征关税门槛、美国 de minimis、各平台包邮门槛，全部应作为边界点显式覆盖。</p>\n<p><strong>组合覆盖用 pairwise 换掉爆炸。</strong> 朴素全组合是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N = \\prod_{i=1}^{k} \\lvert V_i \\rvert</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2887em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∏</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.989em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>，k 列各 4 个取值即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4^k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。pairwise 只要求<strong>任意两列</strong>的取值对都至少出现一次，用例数下界为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max_{i \\lt j} \\lvert V_i \\rvert \\cdot \\lvert V_j \\rvert</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>，工程上通常落在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(k^2 d^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。NIST 对多个工业缺陷数据集的分析（Kuhn、Wallace、Galligan，NIST Automated Combinatorial Testing for Software 项目，<code>csrc.nist.gov/projects/automated-combinatorial-testing-for-software-systems</code>）显示大多数缺陷由不超过 2 个参数的交互触发，pairwise 因此是性价比拐点：规则维度超过 5 列时默认 pairwise，仅在风控等高危表上做 3-way。</p>\n<p><strong>U 与 A 表的完备性可以静态判定，不必靠测试发现。</strong> DMN 规范要求 Unique 与 Any 策略的决策表完备且一致，OMG 的 DMN 规范（<code>omg.org/spec/DMN</code>）与主流引擎的合规校验都会检查这一点；Apache KIE 的 Drools 10.2.0 已声明支持 DMN 1.6 命名空间。工程上应把完备性校验接进 CI，让&quot;表有洞&quot;在合并前被拒绝。</p>\n<h2 id=\"场景仿真-夹具-黄金用例与历史回放\">场景仿真：夹具、黄金用例与历史回放</h2><p>覆盖度告诉你&quot;测了多少&quot;，仿真告诉你&quot;测出来的对不对&quot;。场景仿真的核心是三种事实来源，它们的成本与真实度依次递增。</p>\n<p><strong>手工夹具（fixture）适合表达协议与边界。</strong> 夹具是显式构造的事实对象，用 JSON 或 builder 表达一个完整领域快照（订单、买家、目的国、HS 编码、风控分）。它靠<strong>可读性与意图</strong>取胜：一个名为 <code>first_order_gold_member_DE_800usd</code> 的夹具，比一千条生产数据更能说明意图，缺点是容易过拟合。</p>\n<p><strong>黄金用例（golden / characterization test）锁住既有行为。</strong> 规则系统改造（引擎升级、DSL 迁移、Drools 迁 OPA）最常见的失败不是新功能错，而是<strong>旧行为被悄悄改变</strong>。做法是从生产 decision log 采样已发生的决策，连同当时的输入与输出冻结为回归基线；变更必须让这批用例输出逐字节一致，除非显式声明该差异是本次意图。这条纪律在 2024—2026 年引擎换代（Drools 7 → Drools 10 / Apache KIE、DMN 1.3 → 1.6 命名空间）期间尤其明显。</p>\n<p><strong>历史回放（backtest / shadow replay）衡量真实影响面。</strong> 把过去 N 天（跨境建议覆盖一个完整大促周期，30—90 天）真实请求重放到新版本，只记录输出不生效，得到差异报告：影响多少比例决策、集中在哪些国家/类目、是否有订单从&quot;放行&quot;翻成&quot;拦截&quot;这类高危翻转。差异要分三类处理——预期内则更新基线，高危翻转则阻断合并，静默变化则要求提交影响面说明。Drools 侧用 KIE 的 Test Scenario（<code>.scesim</code>，表格中写 given/when/then 并断言引擎输出）承载回归套件；OPA 侧用 <code>opa test</code> 跑 <code>test_</code> 前缀的 rego 规则、<code>opa test --coverage</code> 产出覆盖率；CEL 侧依 <code>google/cel-spec</code> 的 conformance 套件保证求值语义一致。</p>\n<p>对<strong>有状态规则</strong>（RETE 的增量求值、需 retract 的会话）仿真还有额外要求：必须断言<strong>事实插入顺序无关性</strong>。同一条规则因插入顺序不同而产出不同结果，是 RETE 实现里的经典缺陷类别，测试必须显式覆盖乱序插入这一维度（RETE 网络结构与真值维护机制见 <a href=\"../rete-incremental-evaluation/agenda-conflict-resolution-truth-maintenance\">../2_rete-incremental-evaluation/2_agenda-conflict-resolution-truth-maintenance.md</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"变更影响回归与规则版本治理\">变更影响回归与规则版本治理</h2><p>前两层测得再全，也只保证&quot;改之前是对的&quot;。真正的线上事故来自变更——而规则变更的<strong>影响面</strong>可以从三个属性推出：变更类型、被改规则的上游引用、以及命中策略的顺序敏感性。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变更类型</th>\n<th>影响面</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n<th>强制门</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>追加新行（不触碰已有行的输入条）</td>\n<td>只在原空洞处新增命中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>全量行覆盖 + 边界用例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>修改某行输入条</td>\n<td>覆盖区域变化，可能与邻行产生新重叠/空洞</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>边界回归 + 重叠/空洞静态校验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>修改输出条目或聚合函数</td>\n<td>命中不变、结果值变</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>黄金用例 + 历史回放 diff</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>删除行 / 重排 F 表顺序</td>\n<td>顺序即语义，可能静默改变其他场景</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>全量回归 + 影子期无翻转</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变更共享事实模型（字段重命名、类型收紧）</td>\n<td>波及所有引用该字段的规则</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>依赖图影响面清单 + 契约测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>引擎或 DMN/FEEL 版本升级</td>\n<td>求值语义、命名空间、函数库差异</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>全量黄金用例逐字节比对</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>规则依赖图是影响面分析的底座。</strong> 一条规则引用的事实类型、字段、共享 declaration 或 ruleflow group 构成一张有向图；变更节点的下游闭包即必须回归的范围。这张图应从规则制品本身解析生成（Drools 的 DRL/DMN 制品、OPA 的 rego 包引用、CEL 的变量声明），而非手工维护——手工清单在第一次紧急变更后就会失真。Cedar 的静态分析（<code>cedar-policy-cli validate</code>/<code>analyze</code>，形式化规范见 Amazon Science 公开项目与 OOPSLA 2024 论文）代表这一方向：把&quot;这条策略是否可能被哪条覆盖&quot;从经验判断变成可计算判断。</p>\n<p><strong>版本化与回滚是回归的兜底。</strong> 每次规则集发布都应有不可变的 ruleset 版本号与生效时间（跨境需按投放市场分别固定生效时刻，因为各时区的大促与监管生效日不同），decision log 每条记录携带所用版本号。这样&quot;回滚&quot;是一次配置切换而非代码发布，且事后审计能精确回答&quot;这笔订单当时用的是哪一版规则&quot;——既是运维需要，也是合规需要。</p>\n<p><strong>CI 门把三层测试固化成可拒绝合并的规则。</strong> 一个可落地的门禁顺序是：规则制品静态校验（完备性/一致性/顺序敏感告警）→ 全量场景回归（黄金用例逐字节一致）→ 覆盖率不低于基线 → 影响面清单已由业务方批准 → 影子流量回放差异率在阈值内。最后一步是灰度：新版本只对部分流量生效，以 decision log 的命中分布为漂移指标，分布突变即自动回滚。职责分离值得强调——<strong>业务方批准规则语义变更，工程方批准求值与性能变更</strong>，同一人不能既写规则又签自己的回归报告。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>规则测试测的不是代码路径，而是输入空间的分段。三层各答一问：覆盖度分析静态回答&quot;表里有没有洞和重叠&quot;，场景仿真动态回答&quot;给定事实跑出来对不对&quot;，影响回归差分回答&quot;这次改动动了谁的场景&quot;。落地的关键决策有四个：区间列做 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 级边界覆盖；维度超过 5 列改 pairwise 而非全组合；用生产 decision log 冻结黄金基线以锁住引擎换代期的旧行为；把依赖图解析、覆盖率基线和影子回放做成可拒绝合并的 CI 门。跨境还多一层约束——监管阈值（IOSS 150 EUR、de minimis、平台费率）与时间边界（大促周期、各国生效日）必须成为显式测试点。规则求值的性能与内存回归属同一治理闭环的另一半，见 <a href=\"../rete-incremental-evaluation/incremental-evaluation-tuning-retract-memory\">../2_rete-incremental-evaluation/3_incremental-evaluation-tuning-retract-memory.md</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"规则测试：决策表覆盖、场景仿真与变更影响回归","id":"规则测试-决策表覆盖-场景仿真与变更影响回归"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：规则测试的三种粒度","id":"核心概念-规则测试的三种粒度"},{"level":2,"text":"决策表覆盖度与边界值分析","id":"决策表覆盖度与边界值分析"},{"level":2,"text":"场景仿真：夹具、黄金用例与历史回放","id":"场景仿真-夹具-黄金用例与历史回放"},{"level":2,"text":"变更影响回归与规则版本治理","id":"变更影响回归与规则版本治理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"规则版本管理、发布/灰度/回滚与决策审计追踪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/business-rule-decision-engine-rete-dmnn-drools-cel-opa/rule-governance-testing-ops/rule-versioning-release-rollback-audit"},"next":{"title":"规则治理与合规：变更审批、RBAC、决策日志与可解释性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/business-rule-decision-engine-rete-dmnn-drools-cel-opa/rule-governance-testing-ops/rule-governance-rbac-compliance-explainability"}}